1"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> AMX, amoxicillin; AMX-CLA, amoxicillin-clavulanate; AZM, azithromycin; CA-RTIs, community-acquired respiratory tract infections; CFU, cefuroxime-axetil; E, exacerbation; CLR, clarithromycin; CRO, ceftriaxone; E-CB, exacerbation of chronic bronchitis; E-COPD, exacerbation of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease; LEV, levofloxacin; MOX, moxifloxacin; n/a, not assessed.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>